{
  "$comment": "Shared request-signing test vectors for the server and the three native clients (08 BR-ID-09 细则「服务端与三端共用一组签名测试向量」; CI checks every implementation against this file). Signing string = upper-case method + \"\\n\" + path without scheme or host, including the raw query string after \"?\" exactly as sent (same percent-encoding and parameter order; no sorting, decoding or dedup) + \"\\n\" + X-Timestamp + \"\\n\" + X-Nonce + \"\\n\" + lowercase_hex(sha256(raw body bytes)); an empty body hashes the empty string. X-Sign = lowercase_hex(HMAC-SHA256(key, signing string)), where the key is the UTF-8 bytes of install_secret. Fields: note = what the case exercises; method = the signing-string method component as given (not a client API argument that would be upper-cased first); path = the signed path; body_utf8 = the exact body text, encoded as UTF-8 bytes without JSON parsing or reserialization, empty string meaning zero bytes; timestamp = the literal X-Timestamp header value; server_time = the server clock in Unix seconds, injected for the skew check; nonce = the literal X-Nonce header value; install_secret = a test value, always prefixed with test- and never a real device key; expected_signing_string and expected_sign (valid cases only) = the signing string and X-Sign computed by the rule above; expected_reason (invalid cases only) = the single rule the case breaks. valid_cases pass every check: X-Timestamp is a 10-digit integer, |server_time - timestamp| <= 300 (exactly +300 and -300 are included), X-Nonce is 32 lower-case hex characters, method is upper case, path starts with \"/\" and has no scheme or host. invalid_cases each break exactly one rule and the server answers 10401: time_skew (|server_time - timestamp| > 300; +301 and -301 included), timestamp_format (not exactly 10 digits), nonce_length (not 32 characters), nonce_hex (32 characters but not all hex), nonce_case (32 hex characters with upper case), method_case (method not upper case), path_domain (path carries a scheme or host). Their other fields are valid, so no expected signature is given. Not covered here: X-Device-Id validity (10402), nonce replay within 600 seconds per device_id, and the H5 bridge signing path (BR-ID-32).",
  "version": 1,
  "valid_cases": [
    {
      "note": "BR-ID-09 example: links open with query and JSON body, server time equals ts",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/links/abc/open?src=agent",
      "body_utf8": "{\"no_rebate\":false}",
      "timestamp": "1790661600",
      "server_time": 1790661600,
      "nonce": "b5a8f07b9dda63c3f78ed24c341d25b3",
      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",
      "expected_signing_string": "POST\n/v1/links/abc/open?src=agent\n1790661600\nb5a8f07b9dda63c3f78ed24c341d25b3\ne656157d50842895976f927a859fc8658503d498c2decbb994aba12bd18a1c5a",
      "expected_sign": "5715b672cfc2e52a082392ba4d6997110ae6f9583dc076c6ce8b8df0bc9eeb66"
    },
    {
      "note": "empty body: sha256 of zero bytes (e3b0c442...b855)",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/links/abc/open",
      "body_utf8": "",
      "timestamp": "1790661600",
      "server_time": 1790661600,
      "nonce": "815affc86096929c944a8b0d6a79627b",
      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",
      "expected_signing_string": "POST\n/v1/links/abc/open\n1790661600\n815affc86096929c944a8b0d6a79627b\ne3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "expected_sign": "2b235155f7b5c27ba65773b1bd043e67cf1ef5569dac05619ce8026af0bbc036"
    },
    {
      "note": "non-ASCII body (CJK, full-width punctuation, 4-byte emoji) hashed as raw UTF-8 bytes; spacing kept, no JSON reserialization",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/inputs/parse",
      "body_utf8": "{\"text\": \"复制这段文字打开 凑狸测试商品，¥99 👍\"}",
      "timestamp": "1790661600",
      "server_time": 1790661600,
      "nonce": "8cc81ffe089dd190b5b8dfdb97fbcbe4",
      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",
      "expected_signing_string": "POST\n/v1/inputs/parse\n1790661600\n8cc81ffe089dd190b5b8dfdb97fbcbe4\nb8175f9465d0d2e3951abe27a75d47d52ed0f7079a280eb71f7ae72e90e126ab",
      "expected_sign": "8536f2f18d484b9b05d55aee03b68c6eb99cf8a1abb22f88cfa899c44c61fe09"
    },
    {
      "note": "unsorted, percent-encoded query kept as sent: no sorting, no decoding",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/links/convert?b=2&a=1&c=%E4%B8%AD",
      "body_utf8": "{\"url\":\"https://example.com/item?id=1\"}",
      "timestamp": "1790661600",
      "server_time": 1790661600,
      "nonce": "e1d272c45ff3520a4e4c8aedd1ab33d6",
      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-b",
      "expected_signing_string": "POST\n/v1/links/convert?b=2&a=1&c=%E4%B8%AD\n1790661600\ne1d272c45ff3520a4e4c8aedd1ab33d6\n85820a5732f799cce7ee14e34e7b6df81e40d792ede15b137be12a6f9739aecf",
      "expected_sign": "6d81bf8813f0845403f36303b1676c8467b86a048c69e37e1f6377c5a494294a"
    },
    {
      "note": "repeated key, empty value and lower-case percent-encoding kept as sent: no dedup, no case normalisation",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/links/abc/open?tag=x&tag=a&empty=&q=%e4%b8%ad",
      "body_utf8": "",
      "timestamp": "1790661600",
      "server_time": 1790661600,
      "nonce": "baf337a6e314562116d576e8902617f7",
      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-b",
      "expected_signing_string": "POST\n/v1/links/abc/open?tag=x&tag=a&empty=&q=%e4%b8%ad\n1790661600\nbaf337a6e314562116d576e8902617f7\ne3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "expected_sign": "1001c284ccd7e9e3cc7b00761d1449ee7a6930cdf9ab5365677754066b1cf4e7"
    },
    {
      "note": "time boundary: server_time - ts = +300 (client clock 300 s slow), accepted",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/withdrawals",
      "body_utf8": "{\"amount_cent\":1000}",
      "timestamp": "1790661600",
      "server_time": 1790661900,
      "nonce": "a55de6e0a13c94258463aeb4c5e76144",
      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",
      "expected_signing_string": "POST\n/v1/withdrawals\n1790661600\na55de6e0a13c94258463aeb4c5e76144\necf0347e0739fe7acc58ab7e16d7b2f7ed537430da4e3897b5c37b9e2176daa9",
      "expected_sign": "c3bb190239c6e31586de2277199ab837a53ff717c718f05c6362445cfdbcc4ae"
    },
    {
      "note": "time boundary: server_time - ts = -300 (client clock 300 s fast), accepted",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/withdrawals",
      "body_utf8": "{\"amount_cent\":1000}",
      "timestamp": "1790661600",
      "server_time": 1790661300,
      "nonce": "91819a5a76026e612f67d70b7eeb7c21",
      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",
      "expected_signing_string": "POST\n/v1/withdrawals\n1790661600\n91819a5a76026e612f67d70b7eeb7c21\necf0347e0739fe7acc58ab7e16d7b2f7ed537430da4e3897b5c37b9e2176daa9",
      "expected_sign": "4d1b29a030a24a26bea53b6500e970497233aef7d935f1d0a9e89ffe10b97a2c"
    },
    {
      "note": "install_secret longer than the 64-byte HMAC block (key is hashed first per RFC 2104)",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/auth/refresh",
      "body_utf8": "",
      "timestamp": "1790661600",
      "server_time": 1790661600,
      "nonce": "ec7e1848879d741def3a23c93432acf2",
      "install_secret": "test-only.install.key.longer.than.the.sixty-four.byte.hmac.block.size.so.it.is.hashed.first",
      "expected_signing_string": "POST\n/v1/auth/refresh\n1790661600\nec7e1848879d741def3a23c93432acf2\ne3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "expected_sign": "c082952ce98e6d897a86c4b9c836cd082c5e438d342f4f88416131452ec93abb"
    }
  ],
